36", "message": "Add Digital Notebook Mini Project\n\nAdded Tkinter GUI project with Notes, To-Do, Calculator, and Search tabs.\r\nJSON used for data persistence.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:38:35Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3313456bac8d9631de86b5ff677e29c796d98706", "message": "Delete notes.json", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:32:56Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "38a2beab490fe3b3ea2561588e83565d2048a760", "message": "Delete data.py", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:32:37Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "23c186d5e615dbf7c69d7282d89c4879b59d2360", "message": "Added Dynamic Programming pathfinder\n\nImplemented a grid-based optimal path finder using Dynamic Programming.\r\nThe algorithm recursively computes the minimum cost path from the top-left \r\nto bottom-right corner while avoiding obstacles (1s). \r\nIncludes path visualization using '*' markers in console output.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:29:07Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6af044adec9e744ebeabccffcbafd519548cd4cb", "message": "Delete Optimal_Path_Finder.cpp", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:25:52Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "63c56ec7d926f0b312b290121a96a2bf1a0fc228", "message": "Add Digital Notebook Mini Project\n\nThis commit adds a Python-based Digital Notebook app using Tkinter.\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Notes tab for creating, saving, and deleting notes\r\n- To-do list with add, delete, and mark-done options\r\n- Built-in calculator\r\n- Search functionality across saved notes\r\n- Help section with usage instructions\r\n\r\nData is saved locally using JSON files.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:17:59Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f11d19c151be2d1356c14e42c219e04cbb763814", "message": "Added Dynamic Programming pathfinder\n\nImplemented a grid-based optimal path finder using Dynamic Programming.\r\nThe algorithm recursively computes the minimum cost path from the top-left \r\nto bottom-right corner while avoiding obstacles (1s). \r\nIncludes path visualization using '*' markers in console output.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:08:04Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fbdf717e2bc2679d87b0e379da8bfd6cbe758505", "message": "Added A* Pathfinding Visualizer\n\nCreated an interactive grid-based A* algorithm visualizer using Pygame.\r\nUsers can set start, end, and barriers with mouse clicks and press SPACE to run.\r\nIncludes clear grid option and improved path visualization.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:49:55Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f53b0f10b23e06882380c651b9a64adb8dadf82", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:41:27Z", "repo": "AStar-Pathfinding-Visualizer", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}